{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtSchurDiagonal","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.RegularHom","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.FreeModule.Finite.Matrix"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension.finrank_group_algebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension.finrank_group_algebra","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtBlockDimension.lean#L67-L78","doc":"**The source side.** `dim_k k[S_n] = n!`.\n\n`MonoidAlgebra k G` is `G →₀ k`, free on `G`, so its dimension is `|G| = n!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension.finrank_specht_blocks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension.finrank_specht_blocks","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtBlockDimension.lean#L56-L64","doc":"**The target side.** The Wedderburn target `∏_{μ ⊢ n} End_k (S^μ)` has `k`-dimension\n`Σ_μ (dim_k S^μ)²`.\n\nThis is the right-hand side of the RSK sum-of-squares. It is a statement about the *target*\nof the conjectured isomorphism, not about `k[S_n]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension.finrank_pi_end","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtBlockDimension.finrank_pi_end","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtBlockDimension.lean#L45-L53","doc":"`dim_k (∏_i End_k V_i) = Σ_i (dim_k V_i)²` for a finite family of finite free modules. ","signatureChunk":0}]}